    "created_at": "2020-01-11T08:07:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-11T08:07:18Z",
    "body": "If I remember correctly `NodeIterator` and `TreeWalker` were only implemented in a cross-browser fashion following Acid3. And that was probably the wrong decision and we should have tried to get them removed instead as by then lots of other ways were added to traverse the DOM as well.",
